                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>Skillbook Organizes Graphic Designing Workshop for ITI and ADCA Students
                                    Skillbook Skill Development Centre held an engaging Graphic Designing Workshop on June 6 and 7, 2024, at its Rohini Sector-6 location near Visram Chowk. The workshop was attended by students from ITI Mangolpuri as well as ADCA students from Skillbook, all eager to learn and enhance their skills in the world of graphic design.
                                    The workshop provided in-depth knowledge on various aspects of graphic designing, with a focus on how these skills can not only open doors for personal and professional growth but also create opportunities for earning part-time income. Students learned the practical applications of graphic design in today’s technology-driven world and how even a small set of skills can make a big impact on their career paths.
                                    Conducted over two days, the workshop was free for all participants, reinforcing Skillbook’s commitment to student welfare and skill development. The interactive sessions kept students highly engaged, and by the end of the workshop, they expressed their gratitude, leaving with smiles and new skills they were excited to put into practice.
                                    The workshop was a resounding success, with participants praising the knowledge they gained and thanking Skillbook for the opportunity.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
